      "definition": "(1) \"Blended learning\" means the delivery of instruction in a combination of time primarily in a supervised physical location away from home and online delivery whereby the student has some element of control over time, place, path, or pace of learning and includes noncomputer-based learning opportunities.",
      "id": "3301.079-blended-learning",
      "normalized": "blended learning",
      "scope": "(J) As used in this section:",
      "section": "3301.079",
      "source_title": "Section 3301.079 - Academic standards - model curriculum.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-3301.079",
      "term": "Blended learning"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(2) \"Online learning\" means students work primarily from their residences on assignments delivered via an internet- or other computer-based instructional method.",
      "id": "3301.079-online-learning",
      "normalized": "online learning",
      "scope": "(J) As used in this section:",
      "section": "3301.079",
      "source_title": "Section 3301.079 - Academic standards - model curriculum.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-3301.079",
      "term": "Online learning"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(3) \"Coherence\" means a reflection of the structure of the discipline being taught.",
      "id": "3301.079-coherence",
      "normalized": "coherence",
      "scope": "(J) As used in this section:",
      "section": "3301.079",
      "source_title": "Section 3301.079 - Academic standards - model curriculum.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-3301.079",
      "term": "Coherence"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(4) \"Digital learning\" means learning facilitated by technology that gives students some element of control over time, place, path, or pace of learning.",
      "id": "3301.079-digital-learning",
      "normalized": "digital learning",
      "scope": "(J) As used in this section:",
      "section": "3301.079",
      "source_title": "Section 3301.079 - Academic standards - model curriculum.",
      "source_url": "https://codes.ohio.gov/ohio-revised-code/section-3301.079",
      "term": "Digital learning"
    },
    {
      "definition": "(5) \"Focus\" means limiting the number of items included in a curriculum to allow for deeper exploration of the subject matter.",
      "id": "3301.079-focus",
      "normalized": "focus",
      "scope": "(J) As used in this section:",
      "section": "3301.079",
