    {
      "definition": "(6) \"Vertical articulation\" means key academic concepts and skills associated with mastery in particular content areas should be articulated and reinforced in a developmentally appropriate manner at each grade level so that over time students acquire a depth of knowledge and understanding in the core academic disciplines.\n\nLast updated July 21, 2025 at 12:47 PM",
